  "details": "So this started yesterday out of nowhere, \neverytime i log in with my account, or when im downloading/loading a world the screen goes black and after a few minutes a screen pops up saying connection timed out. \nI have already done any kind of troubleshooting, like cleaning the game and windows cache, re-installing the game, using someone else account, play it from another computer, launch the game from the website........and nothing happened so far.\nFrom time to time, it does load some worlds, and sometimes it does not.\nMy internet works just fine, i can surf on the internet or play any other game without having any type of issue.\nAny help?",
